 "discrepancies": {
  "KGZ_vintage": "NSC revises EAEU trade upward in its July 'refined totals' (late reports, survey estimates): full-year 2025 EAEU imports 4,772.1 -> 5,465.8 m USD (+14.5%), exports 1,152.0 -> 1,322.9 (+14.8%); January-August 2025 imports 2,674.4 -> 3,253.5 (+21.7%), exports 674.6 -> 851.8 (+26.3%). UN Comtrade holds lower figures for 2024 (imports from Russia 2,309.7 vs NSC 2,739.8; exports 976.1 vs 1,151.7), 2025 (2,595.8 vs 3,366.8; 493.3 vs 738.5) and 2020 (1,089.8 vs 1,319.9; 217.5 vs 257.3), and the same figures as the NSC for 2021-2023. Not a basis difference (dispatch vs origin would also show in 2021-2023); most likely Comtrade kept an early or partial submission. The NSC turnover with Russia (2025: 4.11bn USD) sits between Comtrade (3.09bn) and Russian officials' figure (above 5bn).",
  "KGZ_mirror_2020": "actuals_r7 quotes Russia's exports / Kyrgyz imports = 1.34 for 2020 (against Comtrade's low 2020 Kyrgyz figure); against the NSC/EEC figure it is 1.10, in line with 2019 (1.11) and 2021 (1.13).",
  "ARM_origin_vs_trading_country": "The site uses Armenia's imports by country of origin. Imports with Russia as trading (dispatch) country are 2-12% higher (2021: 1.998 vs 1.785bn USD; 2024: 9.43 vs 9.24; 2025: 4.87 vs 4.69; Jan-Aug 2026: 2.03 vs 1.94). Payment goes to the seller, so the trading-country figure is the better high bound for money paid to Russia; base and years move together, so the effect on the change is small.",
  "ARM_exports_revisions": "Armstat's current exports to Russia are above Comtrade by 3.2% (2019), 11.3% (2020), 5.9% (2021), 1.0-1.9% (2022-2024), 0% (2025). Re-exports to Russia (Armenia's cars, electronics, gold) are inside these totals in both versions; no Russia-side figure exists after 2021 to test them.",
  "KAZ_2025": "Comtrade's 2025 figures are 1.3-1.4% above those implied by BNS's annual release (imports from Russia 29.7% of 64,847.0 m USD = 19.26bn vs 19.54bn; exports 10.3% of 79,041.2 = 8.14bn vs 8.25bn). Within the actuals_r7 band (-4%/+6%); no change proposed.",
  "BLR": "EEC 2019-2021 pair values (Belstat basis) equal trade_full.json centrals to 0.0%; nothing after 2021 (EEC stopped, Belstat portal ends 2021)."
 },
